   "design": "The work management system holds a table of which technical specification conditions apply to each equipment item, so the operator opens those conditions directly instead of searching, and still reads each one. The out-of-service list and its time limits are built from open authorizations by fixed rules, instead of being kept by hand. Reviewing, field checks, discussion, signing, releasing, the log, briefings and calls stay with the operator. Any change to these tools goes through the plant's change process.",
   "previous_blocker": "Conditions were searched in the specifications and the list kept by hand.",
   "enabler_now": "Equipment-to-condition tables and lists built from open work.",
   "still_hard": "Several jobs that together affect a safety function.",
   "human_edge": "Seeing that two harmless jobs together are not harmless.",
